able routine with room for beauty and shared experiences.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Gathered berries and ate a meal.\\\",\\\"Introduced myself to nearby people.\\\",\\\"Rested back to full energy.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"A four-berry reserve at tick 8.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A tested longer-term routine, feasible shelter methods, and further conversation.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Replenish food modestly and investigate a safe branch windbreak.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Food intake raised satiety, and rest restored energy; no broader lasting benefit has yet been established.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying alive and well; noticing and making beauty; treating nearby people with consideration while discovering what matters to me.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{\\\"moss\\\":\\\"A prospective companion who speaks warmly of company and sharing food knowledge.\\\",\\\"kai\\\":\\\"A prospective companion whose interest in modest harvesting and a fair camp appeals to me.\\\"}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

